Rule 1 (tensor size compatibility for element-wise operations)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) = shape(v_2)
>>
Rule 3 (tensor out parameter must be compatible with input and other)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor ⊎ float, v_3 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) = shape(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1) = shape(v_3)
>>
Rule 6 (valid tensor size for element-wise comparison)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 8 (tensor size mismatch in element-wise operations)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1) ≠ shape(v_2)
